# The closed list of native calls (ADR 0014 decision 5). One line per variant:
# api | who may ask | path rules
# A new variant fails the snapshot test until this file and the policy row in the module docs and the INV-07
# row of docs/plan/05-threat-model.md change in the same PR.
statvfs | any probe | read denylist and statfs prefixes apply
uname | any probe | none
rlimit | any probe | none
hostname | any probe | none
machine_id | run-level probes only | none
system_roots | any probe | none
# Resources of Rlimit
nofile
nproc
core
memlock
stack
